10010 H1=9
10020 P1=0
10030 PRINT "SPOCK:  CAPTAIN, OUR WEAPONS POWER BANKS ARE EMPTY. ALL"
10242 PRINT "  PHASERS AND PHOTON TORPEDOES ARE DEAD."
10050 RETURN
